WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:05.747
Replying to messages

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:12.336
Open Messages. Unread conversations show a number. Click one to read it.

00:00:19.349 --> 00:00:22.258
Type your reply in the box at the bottom.

00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:36.842
Press Enter, or the arrow button, to send. Your message appears on the right.

00:00:40.471 --> 00:00:45.141
Reply sent
